   ],
   "revision_words": [
    10
   ],
   "added_before_sanction": null,
   "sanctioned_words_before": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_after": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_during": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "sec2-3",
   "section": "Content",
   "text": "In 2023, the Southern Poverty Law Center identified Evie as a preeminent publication supporting the male supremacist politics of the hard right.",
   "words": 22,
   "authors": [
    "Editor 1"
   ],
   "author_words": [
    22
   ],
   "author_sanctioned": false,
   "sanctioned_words": 0,
   "added_revision": 1303951888,
   "revisions": [
    1303951888
   ],
   "revision_words": [
    22
   ],
   "added_before_sanction": null,
   "sanctioned_words_before": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_after": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_during": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "sec2-4",
   "section": "Content",
   "text": "In 2025, The New York Times described Evie content as promoting \"positions that are fringe even within conservative circles — criticisms of no-fault divorce and I.V.F., for example — packaged in a fun and approachable format.\"",
   "words": 37,
   "authors": [
    "Editor 1"
   ],
   "author_words": [
    37
   ],
   "author_sanctioned": false,
   "sanctioned_words": 0,
   "added_revision": 1303951888,
   "revisions": [
    1303951888
   ],
   "revision_words": [
    37
   ],
   "added_before_sanction": null,
   "sanctioned_words_before": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_after": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_during": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "sec2-5",
   "section": "Content",
   "text": "Wired characterized Evie approach to its content as \"a classic example of soft power in action—just as the appeal of mid-century Hollywood films wasn't necessarily the anti-Communist messaging but the glitz and glamour, the strength of Evie politics are in its pretense that it doesn't have any.\"",
   "words": 52,
   "authors": [
    "Editor 1"
   ],
   "author_words": [
    52
   ],
   "author_sanctioned": false,
   "sanctioned_words": 0,
   "added_revision": 1340098208,
   "revisions": [
    1340098208
   ],
   "revision_words": [
    52
   ],
   "added_before_sanction": null,
   "sanctioned_words_before": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_after": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_during": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "sec2-6",
   "section": "Content",
   "text": "Evie has published misinformation about COVID-19 and vaccines, transphobic content and conspiracy theories, including QAnon, and Pizzagate.",
   "words": 18,
   "authors": [
    "Editor 1",
    "Editor 10",
    "Editor 12"
   ],
   "author_words": [
    16,
    1,
    1
   ],
   "author_sanctioned": false,
   "sanctioned_words": 0,
   "added_revision": 1303951888,
   "revisions": [
    1303951888,
    1325616856,
    1335354759
   ],
   "revision_words": [
    16,
    1,
    1
   ],
   "added_before_sanction": null,
   "sanctioned_words_before": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_after": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_during": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "sec2-7",
   "section": "Content",
   "text": "Articles in Evie have denounced the body positivity movement and urged women to stop using hormonal contraception.",
   "words": 17,
   "authors": [
    "Editor 7",
    "Editor 1"
   ],
   "author_words": [
    11,
    6
   ],
   "author_sanctioned": false,
   "sanctioned_words": 0,
   "added_revision": 1261295537,
   "revisions": [
