   ],
   "added_before_sanction": null,
   "sanctioned_words_before": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_after": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_during": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "sec2-9",
   "section": "Content",
   "text": "In 2021, Vice said that Evie \"attempt[s] to fit vaccine skepticism and outright COVID denial into what's represented as a 'classical' and 'traditional' worldview...",
   "words": 26,
   "authors": [
    "Editor 1"
   ],
   "author_words": [
    26
   ],
   "author_sanctioned": false,
   "sanctioned_words": 0,
   "added_revision": 1265675393,
   "revisions": [
    1265675393,
    1303951888
   ],
   "revision_words": [
    24,
    2
   ],
   "added_before_sanction": null,
   "sanctioned_words_before": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_after": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_during": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "sec2-10",
   "section": "Content",
   "text": "While they are, in and of themselves, nothing especially original, Evie anti-vax blogs provide[s] a neat little window into how COVID denialism and misinformation are being marketed in one particularly cynical corner of right-wing women's media.\"",
   "words": 40,
   "authors": [
    "Editor 1"
   ],
   "author_words": [
    40
   ],
   "author_sanctioned": false,
   "sanctioned_words": 0,
   "added_revision": 1265675393,
   "revisions": [
    1265675393,
    1266776915
   ],
   "revision_words": [
    29,
    11
   ],
   "added_before_sanction": null,
   "sanctioned_words_before": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_after": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_during": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "sec2-11",
   "section": "Content",
   "text": "In March 2024, Evie was cited by The Washington Post as an example of \"prominent conservative commentators ... sowing misinformation as a way to discourage the use of birth control.\"",
   "words": 29,
   "authors": [
    "Editor 1"
   ],
   "author_words": [
    29
   ],
   "author_sanctioned": false,
   "sanctioned_words": 0,
   "added_revision": 1265675393,
   "revisions": [
    1265675393
   ],
   "revision_words": [
    29
   ],
   "added_before_sanction": null,
   "sanctioned_words_before": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_after": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_during": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "sec2-12",
   "section": "Content",
   "text": "In August 2024, Futurism characterized Evie as an alt-right women's lifestyle publication whose content \"range[s] from innocuous lifestyle posts about fashion trends to a range of bizarre and often harmful content including vaccine misinformation, a bevy of wildly unscientific assertions about women's health, anti-trans fearmongering, unsupported 'psyop' conspiracies, and pro-life messaging that often includes false claims about safe and effective abortion drugs.\"",
   "words": 68,
   "authors": [
    "Editor 1"
   ],
   "author_words": [
    68
   ],
   "author_sanctioned": false,
   "sanctioned_words": 0,
   "added_revision": 1265675393,
   "revisions": [
    1265675393,
    1299588101,
    1303951888
   ],
   "revision_words": [
    66,
    1,
    1
   ],
   "added_before_sanction": null,
   "sanctioned_words_before": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_after": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_during": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "sec2-13",
   "section": "Content",
   "text": "It added, \"In other words, Evie isn't a reliable source of news and information, nor is it simply a conservative outlet.",
   "words": 22,
   "authors": [
    "Editor 1"
   ],
   "author_words": [
    22
   ],
   "author_sanctioned": false,
   "sanctioned_words": 0,
   "added_revision": 1265675393,
   "revisions": [
    1265675393
   ],
   "revision_words": [
    22
   ],
   "added_before_sanction": null,
   "sanctioned_words_before": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_after": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_during": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "sec2-14",
   "section": "Content",
   "text": "It's a deeply conspiratorial website that ignores scientific facts and critical reasoning\", citing an Evie article asserting that a \"recent projection\" had found that 45% of women were expected to be single and childless by 2030; the estimate was from a Morgan Stanley report published in September 2019.",
   "words": 49,
   "authors": [
    "Editor 1"
   ],
   "author_words": [
    49
   ],
   "author_sanctioned": false,
   "sanctioned_words": 0,
   "added_revision": 1265675393,
   "revisions": [
    1265675393
   ],
   "revision_words": [
    49
   ],
   "added_before_sanction": null,
   "sanctioned_words_before": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_after": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_during": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "sec2-15",
   "section": "Content",
   "text": "According to NBC News which talks about the case of Evie'''s attitude towards birth control, the studies about the matters discussed are conflicting and suitable methods should be decided on a case-by-case basis: \"Rather, health care experts have said that doctors should discuss any potential mood effects of the medication with patients, as other studies have contradicted the 2018 study, and pregnancy can also have mood side effects.\"",
   "words": 71,
   "authors": [
    "Editor 3"
   ],
   "author_words": [
    71
   ],
   "author_sanctioned": false,
   "sanctioned_words": 0,
   "added_revision": 1320907214,
   "revisions": [
    1320907214,
    1320937594
   ],
   "revision_words": [
    63,
    8
   ],
   "added_before_sanction": null,
   "sanctioned_words_before": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_after": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_during": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "sec2-16",
   "section": "Content",
   "text": "Dr. Danielle Jones, an OB-GYN, said that fertility awareness methods are complicated and could fail, while Mayo Clinic said that fertility cycle tracking is less effective than other methods.",
   "words": 30,
   "authors": [
    "Editor 3"
   ],
   "author_words": [
    30
   ],
   "author_sanctioned": false,
   "sanctioned_words": 0,
   "added_revision": 1320907214,
   "revisions": [
    1320907214
   ],
   "revision_words": [
    30
   ],
   "added_before_sanction": null,
   "sanctioned_words_before": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_after": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_during": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "sec2-17",
   "section": "Content",
   "text": "The New York Times has described some perspectives published on Evie as \"unconventional for a right-leaning publication\", such as sharing sex tips with disclaimers saying \"married women only\", advising women to resist being pressured into sexual acts, criticizing misogyny in online communities, and having models wear bikinis and crop tops.",
   "words": 51,
   "authors": [
    "Editor 2",
    "Editor 3"
   ],
   "author_words": [
    47,
    4
   ],
   "author_sanctioned": false,
   "sanctioned_words": 0,
   "added_revision": 1353368894,
   "revisions": [
    1353368894,
    1320907214
   ],
   "revision_words": [
